{# Says what Pro adds on this screen, without nagging.

   The rule the whole plugin follows: Lite is a working support desk, not a demo. So this appears
   *beside* a feature that is genuinely absent, explains what it does, and never covers up
   something that works. #}
<div class="readable csr-callout">
    <p><strong>{{ heading ?? 'A Pro feature'|t('csr') }}</strong></p>
    <p class="light">{{ body }}</p>
</div>
